 party, and grand buffet meals.\";s:14:\"featured_image\";s:72:\"http://127.0.0.1:8000/storage/uploads/packages/1788242608_aPTFqiQ6UI.png\";s:10:\"inclusions\";a:6:{i:0;s:39:\"Welcome Mocktails & Executive Breakfast\";i:1;s:47:\"Unlimited Royal Buffet Lunch & Evening High Tea\";i:2;s:52:\"Spacious Lawn for Corporate Team Building Activities\";i:3;s:51:\"Dedicated Event Anchor / Coordinator for Team Games\";i:4;s:31:\"Rain Dance with DJ Sound System\";i:5;s:38:\"Projector / PA System Setup on Request\";}s:10:\"exclusions\";a:2:{i:0;s:19:\"Alcoholic Beverages\";i:1;s:48:\"Special Custom Stage Setup (Available on Add-on)\";}s:6:\"status\";s:6:\"active\";s:10:\"created_at\";s:25:\"2026-08-31T08:40:07+00:00\";}i:4;a:19:{s:2:\"id\";i:34;s:5:\"title\";s:13:\"Group Package\";s:8:\"title_mr\";s:80:\"ग्रुप व ग्रुप गेट-टुगेदर पॅकेज\";s:8:\"title_en\";s:13:\"Group Package\";s:4:\"slug\";s:13:\"group-package\";s:8:\"duration\";s:25:\"1 Day (Minimum 15 Guests)\";s:11:\"duration_mr\";s:63:\"१ दिवस (किमान १५ व्यक्ती)\";s:11:\"duration_en\";s:25:\"1 Day (Minimum 15 Guests)\";s:17:\"short_description\";s:113:\"Special discounted group rates for kitty parties, senior citizen groups, society gatherings, and friend reunions.\";s:20:\"short_description_mr\";s:254:\"मित्र-मैत्रिणी, ज्येष्ठ नागरिक मंडळे आणि सोसायटी ग्रुप्ससाठी सवलतीच्या दरातील खास ग्रुप पॅकेज.\";s:20:\"short_description_en\";s:113:\"Special discounted group rates for kitty parties, senior citizen groups, society gatherings, and friend reunions.\";s:11:\"description\";s:164:\"Perfect for large gatherings of 15+ members. Enjoy private seating gazebos, nostalgic rural games, farm tours, swimming pool fun, and hot traditional food together.\";s:14:\"description_mr\";s:405:\"१५ पेक्षा जास्त व्यक्तींच्या समूहासाठी खास सवलत. एकत्र गप्पा मारण्यासाठी खाजगी जागा, स्विमिंग पूल, बैलगाडी राईड आणि गरमागरम चुलीवरच्या जेवणाची मेजवानी.\";s:14:\"description_en\";s:164:\"Perfect for large gatherings of 15+ members. Enjoy private seating gazebos, nostalgic rural games, farm tours, swimming pool fun, and hot traditional food together.\";s:14:\"featured_image\";s:72:\"http://127.0.0.1:8000/storage/uploads/packages/1788246211_MuL5OIkQNX.jpg\";s:10:\"inclusions\";a:6:{i:0;s:32:\"Special Group Discounted Pricing\";i:1;s:55:\"Complete Meal Package: Breakfast, Lunch, Evening Snacks\";i:2;s:39:\"Reserved Group Dining & Relaxation Area\";i:3;s:47:\"Full Access to Pool, Rain Dance, and Farm Walks\";i:4;s:30:\"Group Photoshoot Spots & Props\";i:5;s:44:\"Musical Setup for Antakshari / Group Singing\";}s:10:\"exclusions\";a:2:{i:0;s:26:\"Individual Room Allocation\";i:1;s:14:\"Transportation\";}s:6:\"status\";s:6:\"active\";s:10:\"created_at\";s:25:\"2026-08-31T08:40:07+00:00\";}i:5;a:19:{s:2:\"id\";i:35;s:5:\"title\";s:22:\"Overnight Stay Package\";s:8:\"title_mr\";s:85:\"मुक्काम कॉटेज स्टे पॅकेज (२४ तास)\";s:8:\"title_en\";s:22:\"Overnight Stay Package\";s:4:\"slug\";s:22:\"overnight-stay-package\";s:8:\"duration\";s:50:\"24 Hours (Check-in 12:00 PM – Next Day 10:00 AM)\";s:11:\"duration_mr\";s:124:\"२४ तास (चेक-इन दुपारी १२:०० – दुसऱ्या दिवशी १०:००)\";s:11:\"duration_en\";s:50:\"24 Hours (Check-in 12:00 PM – Next Day 10:00 AM)\";s:17:\"short_description\";s:114:\"Luxury AC eco-cottage stay with all 4 meals (Lunch, High Tea, Dinner, Breakfast), night bonfire, and sunrise walk.\";s:20:\"short_description_mr\";s:248:\"वातानुकूलित लक्झरी कॉटेज मुक्काम, सर्व ४ वेळचे जेवण, रात्रीची शेकोटी आणि रम्य पहाट शिवार फेरी.\";s:20:\"short_description_en\";s:114:\"Luxury AC eco-cottage stay with all 4 meals (Lunch, High Tea, Dinner, Breakfast), night bonfire, and sunrise walk.\";s:11:\"description\";s:195:\"Rejuvenate with a serene night amidst nature. Stay in cozy AC wooden cottages with private verandas, relish evening bonfires under starry skies, 4 complete meals, and peaceful morning bird walks.\";s:14:\"description_mr\";s:441:\"निसर्गाच्या कुशीत शांत रात्रीचा मुक्काम. वातानुकूलित लाकडी कॉटेज, संध्याकाळी शेकोटी, चारही वेळचे स्वादिष्ट जेवण आणि सकाळी पक्षांच्या किलबिलाटात प्रसन्न शिवार फेरी.\";s:14:\"description_en\";s:195:\"Rejuvenate with a serene night amidst nature. Stay in cozy AC wooden cottages with private verandas, relish evening bonfires under starry skies, 4 complete meals, and peaceful morning bird walks.\";s:14:\"featured_image\";s:72:\"http://127.0.0.1:8000/storage/uploads/packages/1788178782_qyi4sXquWZ.png\";s:10:\"inclusions\";a:6:{i:0;s:50:\"AC Deluxe Nature-View Wooden Cottage Accommodation\";i:1;s:62:\"4 Complete Meals: Lunch, High Tea, Dinner & Next Day Breakfast\";i:2;s:38:\"Evening Cozy Bonfire & Music Gathering\";i:3;s:38:\"Early Morning Guided Sunrise Farm Walk\";i:4;s:50:\"Full 2-Day Access to Pool, Rain Dance & Activities\";i:5;s:30:\"Free Wi-Fi & 24x7 Power Backup\";}s:10:\"exclusions\";a:2:{i:0;s:30:\"Late Check-out beyond 11:00 AM\";i:1;s:29:\"Special Midnight Room Service\";}s:6:\"status\";s:6:\"active\";s:10:\"created_at\";s:25:\"2026-08-31T08:40:07+00:00\";}i:6;a:19:{s:2:\"id\";i:36;s:5:\"title\";s:35:\"Special Village Hurda Party Package\";s:8:\"title_mr\";s:91:\"स्पेशल गावरान हुर्डा पार्टी पॅकेज\";s:8:\"title_en\";s:35:\"Special Village Hurda Party Package\";s:4:\"slug\";s:41:\"special-village-hurda-party-package-kYDBG\";s:8:\"duration\";s:26:\"1 Day (9:00 AM to 6:00 PM)\";s:11:\"duration_mr\";s:80:\"१ दिवस (सकाळी ९ ते संध्याकाळी ६)\";s:11:\"duration_en\";s:26:\"1 Day (9:00 AM to 6:00 PM)\";s:17:\"short_description\";s:101:\"Unlimited Fresh Roasted Hurda, Traditional Chutneys, Wood-Fired Meals, Pool Access & Agro Activities.\";s:20:\"short_description_mr\";s:255:\"ताजा भाजलेला हुर्डा, विविध चटण्या, गुळ-खोबरे, अमर्याद जेवण, स्विमिंग पूल आणि ॲग्रो ॲक्टिव्हिटीज्.\";s:20:\"short_description_en\";s:101:\"Unlimited Fresh Roasted Hurda, Traditional Chutneys, Wood-Fired Meals, Pool Access & Agro Activities.\";s:11:\"description\";s:382:\"Experience the rich winter traditions with our special Hurda Party Package at Visawa Agro Tourism! Enjoy tender, farm-fresh roasted jowar (Hurda) served with authentic spicy chutneys, organic jaggery, and dry coconut. The package includes a welcome breakfast, unlimited wood-fired Maharashtrian lunch, swimming pool & rain dance, bullock cart rides, farm walk, and evening high-tea.\";s:14:\"description_mr\";s:824:\"विसावा ॲग्रो टुरिझमचे खास हिवाळी हुर्डा पार्टी पॅकेज! यामध्ये पर्यटकांना शेतात थेट निखाऱ्यावर भाजलेला गरमागरम हुर्डा, शेंगदाणा-लसूण चटणी, गुळ आणि खोबऱ्याचा आस्वाद घेता येईल. यासोबत सकाळचा नाश्ता, चुलीवरचे अस्सल गावरान दुपारचे जेवण, स्विमिंग पूल, बैलगाडी सफर, शेतीची सफर आणि संध्याकाळचा चहा-नाश्ता समाविष्ट आहे.\";s:14:\"description_en\";s:382:\"Experience the rich winter traditions with our special Hurda Party Package at Visawa Agro Tourism! Enjoy tender, farm-fresh roasted jowar (Hurda) served with authentic spicy chutneys, organic jaggery, and dry coconut. The package includes a welcome breakfast, unlimited wood-fired Maharashtrian lunch, swimming pool & rain dance, bullock cart rides, farm walk, and evening high-tea.\";s:14:\"featured_image\";s:72:\"http://127.0.0.1:8000/storage/uploads/packages/1788177763_vf8c3CCDSB.png\";s:10:\"inclusions\";a:0:{}s:10:\"exclusions\";a:0:{}s:6:\"status\";s:6:\"active\";s:10:\"created_at\";s:25:\"2026-08-31T12:02:44+00:00\";}}', 1788794115);
